<!-- Description Section -->
<section class="prose max-w-none">
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4">Project Overview</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Access to clean water remains one of the most significant challenges in remote mountainous regions. This project aims to install sustainable gravity-fed water systems and solar-powered filtration units in three key village clusters that currently rely on unsafe river sources.
                    </p>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        By providing reliable access to clean water, we aren't just improving health outcomes—we are empowering families. Children can spend more time in school rather than walking hours to fetch water, and local healthcare clinics can operate with the hygiene standards necessary to save lives.
                    </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-stack-md my-stack-lg">
<div class="p-stack-md rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-2" data-icon="opacity">opacity</span>
<h3 class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface mb-1">Sustainable Supply</h3>
<p class="text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Maintenance-free gravity systems designed for 20+ years of use.</p>
</div>
<div class="p-stack-md rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-2" data-icon="health_and_safety">health_and_safety</span>
<h3 class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface mb-1">Health Impact</h3>
<p class="text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">Estimated 75% reduction in waterborne illnesses in the region.</p>
</div>
